Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:03.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Wireless security depends on seeing the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.99,0:00:04.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,evidence clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:08.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,WinWiFi Security Auditor\Nbrings network inventory,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:11.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,threat review, packet\Nanalysis, and reporting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,into one Windows workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:17.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Command Center summarizes\Nnetwork posture, priority
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:19.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,findings, and active cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:22.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,In Networks, search\Naccess points, compare
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,security details, and open a record
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,for technical context.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:29.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,RF Spectrum makes\Nchannel activity across
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:32.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,2.4, 5, and 6 gigahertz easy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,to compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:37.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Threats and Investigations\Nconnect suspicious indicators
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:39.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,with case status, evidence, and analyst
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:40.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.63,0:00:43.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,For packet review, load PCAP or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.15,0:00:46.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,PCAPNG files, filter frames, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:50.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,inspect decoded 802.11 fields
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:51.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside raw bytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:54.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Handshakes organizes EAPOL\Nrecords and supported
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:58.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hashcat 22000 exports\Nfor authorized assessments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.87,0:01:02.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Reports turn findings\Ninto executive context
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,and prioritized remediation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Projects keep assessment scope in view.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,WinWiFi Security Auditor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:11.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Clear evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:13.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Focused analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Actionable reporting.
